"description":"MEMBERSHIP REQUIRED - Exclusive to Crunchyroll Mega and Ultimate Fan Memberships\n\ninbento is a chill pattern-matching puzzle game where you prepare Japanese lunch boxes (bento) while enjoying a cute story about parenthood and growing up.\n\nRecreate over 120 puzzling recipes, master tricky mechanics and learn about the life of the kitten family as you pour your love into the food you create.\n\nSOLVE THE RECIPES\nIn each puzzle you start with a limited number of ingredients and a picture of the final result - rotate, move and insert the food in the right order to rediscover the original recipe and make a delicious dish!\n\nA HEARTWARMING STORY\nFinishing each chapter will reward you with interactive illustrations offering glimpses into the life of a cat family and the ups & downs of parenthood.\n\n120+ MEALS TO PREPARE\nOver the course of the game you will encounter new mechanics that allow you to swap, remove and copy ingredients in order to make the puzzles more exciting!\n\nZERO UNDERSTANDING OF COOKING REQUIRED\nYou don’t need to be a pro chef to play inbento - the game’s relaxed pace and textless tutorial will offer all the guidance you need to have a great time!\n\n** 1st place in The Big Indie Pitch @ PGA 2019 **\n\n————\nCrunchyroll Premium members enjoy ad-free streaming—1,300+ titles, 46,000+ episodes, and simulcasts shortly after they air in Japan. Mega Fan and Ultimate Fan memberships also include offline viewing, Crunchyroll Store discounts, Crunchyroll Game Vault access, multi-device streaming, and more!\n\nPrivacy Policy: https://www.crunchyroll.com/games/privacy\nTerms: https://www.crunchyroll.com/games/terms/", "bundleId":"com.crunchyroll.gv.inbento", "minimumOsVersion":"13.0", "averageUserRatingForCurrentVersion":4.56923000000000012477130439947359263896942138671875, "languageCodesISO2A":["CS", "NL", "EN", "FR", "DE", "IT", "JA", "KO", "NB", "PL", "PT", "RU", "ZH", "SK", "ES", "SV", "ZH"], "fileSizeBytes":"371361792", "formattedPric